From d85ad65f015528ee1fef37de55e6148fb16bd0ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yann Gautier <yann.gautier@st.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Oct 2022 11:38:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 468/572] feat(stm32mp15-fdts): add stm32mp157d-dk1 board

This commit adds stm32mp157d-dk1 board support. This board embeds a
STM32MP157D SOC. This SOC contains the same level of feature than a
STM32MP157A SOC but A7 clock frequency can reach 800MHz.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git 803522d365261934def79dda1e0e4bc70b97de3a feat(stm32mp15-fdts): add stm32mp157d-dk1 board]
Signed-off-by: Alexandre Torgue <alexandre.torgue@foss.st.com>
Signed-off-by: Amelie Delaunay <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Signed-off-by: Yann Gautier <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I05137af3ec475c49ee6f99b9a23f23130ea5892a
---
 fdts/stm32mp157d-dk1-fw-config.dts |  7 +++++++
 fdts/stm32mp157d-dk1.dts           | 27 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 34 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 fdts/stm32mp157d-dk1-fw-config.dts
 create mode 100644 fdts/stm32mp157d-dk1.dts

diff --git a/fdts/stm32mp157d-dk1-fw-config.dts b/fdts/stm32mp157d-dk1-fw-config.dts
